-- =============================================================================
-- 0008 — Starter Island curriculum: missions 4–24 on the mission framework
--
-- Apply after 0004 (replaces 0005 — skip 0005 if it was never applied):
--   psql "$DATABASE_URL" -v ON_ERROR_STOP=1 -f database/migrations/0008_starter_island_curriculum.sql
-- (or paste into the Neon SQL Editor). One transaction; safe to run again.
--
-- Rebuilds missions 4–24 to the curriculum (docs/STARTER_ISLAND_CURRICULUM.md):
-- pushable blocks and construction zones, traffic lights, ordered rescues,
-- pick up / drop, colour sorting, smart gates, hazard zones, layouts that
-- change every run, mission data, coordinates, functions, fog and patrol
-- carts. Each level gets its map, scene, toolbox, briefing, scoring, four
-- tiered hints and objectives (tracked CUSTOM objectives for crates; bonus
-- objectives have required = FALSE). Environments are upserted (Rescue City
-- included). Progress, stars and XP are kept; objective ticks of these
-- levels are reset because their objectives changed.
-- =============================================================================
BEGIN;

